            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "jcschultz1983"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I absolutely love this dish. I agree with some of the others &amp; I added ginger, minced garlic, &amp; a lil garlic powder to the dish while cooking. I also added some soy sauce to my bowl.",
